426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我知道……毕竟制作时碰壁的次数相当惊人。”"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i133"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14564"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这里有被褥，你们两位就在这里住下吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就这样吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13743"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊，我还可以坐渡轮回去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14438"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那就是羽依里先生和我两个人的睡衣派对了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14446"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“因为是第一次，很期待哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13800"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13785"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我、我还是……也住下吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14529"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你会担心吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13884"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13861"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“当然会担心啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12186"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“好嘞！今天也要加油干！”"},{"op":"image","layer"