都回去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好了，我们也回去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13903"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久刚迈出一步。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13873"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎！没事吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她踉跄了几下。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13867"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……可能是一下子觉得有些疲惫。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14531"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾……”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"你是不是太勉强自己了？","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"没关系，不用在意","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":251,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"set","variable":430,"value":1},{"op":"return"},{"op":"goto","target":251},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14534"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“稍微休息一下再走吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯，谢谢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“坐在这里吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……谢谢你，紬。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":769},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1671"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1669"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……你又在一边笑着一边勉强自己了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“因、因为……再不加油的话，就要来不及了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“就是这么做才赶上的嘛……这次就原谅我吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“静久……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1670"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“什么事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我有话要说。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“为什么不多找些人来帮忙呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬和平时的不太一样……带着某种认真的语气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或者说……如果我的直觉没错的话。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1669"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎？那个……总觉得不太好意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“就没想过……减少一些装饰之类的东西吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“因为想为紬和羽依里装扮得豪华一点嘛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬……她在生气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且，是非常认真地在生气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你知道吗，我很担心的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1672"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“你又这样勉强自己……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“心情变得很不好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“到头来会不会又要把很多事情都忘掉了呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1670"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那是……不会的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“真的不会吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬直视着静久的眼睛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“说谎是？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1672"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……禁止的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我……马上就要离开这里了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“没办法再让静久不开心的事变成快乐的事了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“看到现在的静久……我是没法安心离开的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬……对、对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“确实可能……有点勉强了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬……静久她好像也知道错了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"斩钉截铁的否定。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的声音里，仿佛含有着某种决心。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬……继续说道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“静久……这个夏天过得开心吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1670"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……是我至今为止度过的最开心的暑假。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“不想忘记吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1669"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不想忘记……绝对不会忘记。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那么……我要送给静久……一份礼物……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“怎、怎么了？紬？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“为了让静久不再勉强自己……我要……送给你……一份礼物……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1672"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1673"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我好讨厌……最讨厌静久了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……怎么……了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“讨厌……好讨厌……最讨厌你了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“等等，为什么突然……要说这种话呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“为什……么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“才不是突然呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“从一开始就很讨厌！一直……一直都很讨厌！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是、是这样吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“讨厌讨厌讨厌讨厌！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1674"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“对不起……我……还以为……那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“请不要说话！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1675"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“第一次见面的时候……看起来很温柔……对我表现得很温柔……好讨厌！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“一起过夜的时候，给我带来了可爱的玩偶，好讨厌！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“知道我在……收集吕客的罐子……特意帮我吃了很多薯片……好讨厌！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“帮我……打扫……垃圾……好讨厌！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1674"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“还一起去……广播体操……好讨厌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“夸我的头发和眼睛……颜色好看……好讨厌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“帮我掏耳朵……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1676"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“一起为朋友修补……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“一起唱歌…